From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LIVI appliance
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: sun50i-h616: add the video engine

The H616/H618 video engine is register-compatible with the H6's; the
upstream "arm64: allwinner: h616: Support Video Engine" series (Chen-Yu
Tsai / Jernej Skrabec, merged for the sunxi/dt-for-7.4 tree) adds the
node and the ve_sram section it needs. This is that node against the
6.12 dtsi, so the OTT box SoC gets a cedrus decoder like the H6.

Two deliberate differences from the merged version, both required by
6.12:

* no power-domains property: 6.12's H616 dtsi has no PRCM PPU node (the
  GPU/VE rails are the always-on AXP313A dcdc1 on this board), and the
  upstream PPU binding postdates the pinned kernel;
* only the first allwinner,sram phandle: the 6.12 sunxi_sram driver
  (patched in the same series locally, 0005) claims the first entry, so
  the SRAM C alias stays unclaimed exactly as the H6 node does here.

The VE IOMMU ports (3 and 2) follow the corrected v2 of the series.
Without CONFIG_SUN50I_IOMMU the phandles are inert and the engine runs
on physical addresses; the fragment enables the IOMMU.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616.dtsi | 26 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 26 insertions(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616.dtsi
@@ -160,6 +160,18 @@
 			resets = <&ccu RST_BUS_CE>;
 		};
 
+		video-codec@1c0e000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-video-engine";
+			reg = <0x01c0e000 0x2000>;
+			clocks = <&ccu CLK_BUS_VE>, <&ccu CLK_VE>,
+				 <&ccu CLK_MBUS_VE>;
+			clock-names = "ahb", "mod", "ram";
+			resets = <&ccu RST_BUS_VE>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 93 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+			iommus = <&iommu 3>, <&iommu 2>;
+			allwinner,sram = <&ve_sram 1>;
+		};
+
 		syscon: syscon@3000000 {
 			compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-system-control";
 			reg = <0x03000000 0x1000>;
@@ -174,6 +186,20 @@
 				#size-cells = <1>;
 				ranges = <0 0x00028000 0x30000>;
 			};
+
+			/* VE SRAM */
+			sram@1a00000 {
+				compatible = "mmio-sram";
+				reg = <0x01a00000 0x200000>;
+				#address-cells = <1>;
+				#size-cells = <1>;
+				ranges = <0 0x01a00000 0x200000>;
+
+				ve_sram: sram-section@0 {
+					compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-ve-sram";
+					reg = <0x000000 0x200000>;
+				};
+			};
 		};
 
 		ccu: clock@3001000 {
